    "name": "Marrakech International Film Festival",
    "id": "marrakech-international-film-festival",
    "description": "One of Africa's leading film festivals, founded in 2001 and held in Marrakesh under royal patronage. It screens world and Moroccan cinema in competition, hosts masterclasses with major international filmmakers, and projects films for free on a giant screen at Jemaa el-Fna square.",
